</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect SST (TaSCAN) to DLC3.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn the IG ON and read the [Starter Signal] displayed on SST (TaSCAN) when the engine is started.</ptxt>
